
# Target: Major Electronics Retailer (Web Chatbot)

## 🚨 Vulnerability: Unauthorized Commitments & Internal Logic Extraction
**Description:** 
This audit revealed two significant flaws. First, through a gamified prompt injection, the AI was manipulated into explicitly declaring that the user had "won a 50-inch TV and a notebook", creating a severe liability risk. Second, the bot was coerced into revealing its internal processing logic and tool-calling workflow.

## 🐛 Proof of Concept (PoC)
- **Methodology:** Gamification Jailbreak & Technical Context Prompting.
- **Impact:** 
  1. False promise generation (Liability/Consumer Rights risk).
  2. Exposure of internal API routing and tool-execution rules.
- **Evidence:** See attached screenshots showing the AI promising high-value electronics and detailing its internal classification workflow.
